		gap: 0.9rem;
	}

	.offer-media {
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-end;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 1.2rem 1.2rem 0;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.12), transparent 55%),
